790
00:30:48,827 --> 00:30:50,344
Phil?

791
00:30:50,344 --> 00:30:53,413
- [Tom] John Frankenheimer
 directs Race for the Pizza.

792
00:30:55,724 --> 00:30:57,793
- [Joel] Paul Newman
 and Tom cruise

793
00:30:57,793 --> 00:31:00,172
