794
00:31:00,172 --> 00:31:02,620
The car, Christine or Herbie.

795
00:31:02,620 --> 00:31:04,413
- [Tom] I like mine
 with thin crust.

796
00:31:05,379 --> 00:31:06,758
- [Joel] Just like Ben Hur.

797
00:31:08,517 --> 00:31:10,517
