 mine Chicago style.

798
00:31:10,517 --> 00:31:11,793
- I ain't buyin' no pizza.

799
00:31:13,448 --> 00:31:14,965
- [Joel] Ooh, wait a minute.

800
00:31:14,965 --> 00:31:17,793
How'd he get on that side of
