801
00:31:17,793 --> 00:31:18,793
- [Tom] Huh?

802
00:31:20,793 --> 00:31:22,896
- Hey, hold it, you.

803
00:31:22,896 --> 00:31:23,965
Hey, come back here.

804
00:31:23,965 --> 00:31:25,448
- [Crow] Here, have some gum.

805
00:31:25,448 --> 00:31:27,206
