- [Crow] Gotham city, 14 miles.

809
00:31:41,241 --> 00:31:42,103
- [Joel] Cutaway.

810
00:31:43,379 --> 00:31:44,206
- [Crow] Cutaway.

811
00:31:45,862 --> 00:31:47,000
- [Tom] Cutaway.

812
