819
00:32:15,448 --> 00:32:17,241
She's a real Deuce Coupe.

820
00:32:17,241 --> 00:32:18,068
- Hi.

821
00:32:18,068 --> 00:32:19,379
- [Joel] Danny Thomas.

822
00:32:19,379 --> 00:32:20,655
- I just don't believe it.

823
00:32:20,655 --> 00:32:22,655
- [Tom] The things I can
do with my Spirograph.

824
00:32:22,655 --> 00:32:24,206
- Where'd you pass him?

825
00:32:24,206 --> 00:32:25,689
- Just after the start.

826
00:32:25,689 --> 00:32:27,448
- No one's ever beaten
 him through there before.

827
00:32:27,448 --> 00:32:28,758
- [Crow] Well, no
 one else has these.

828
