and I'm an alcoholic.

875
00:34:12,862 --> 00:34:14,310
- Hi, Phil.
 - Hi, Phil.

876
00:34:14,310 --> 00:34:16,413
- Who owns the blue sports
 job out there, HGN227?

877
00:34:17,689 --> 00:34:19,344
- Right here.
 - Step out here, will ya.

878
00:34:20,689 --> 00:34:23,620
- [Tom] Oh, this Walkman
works really well.

879
00:34:25,689 --> 00:34:27,344
- [Joel] Well, we usually
 beat you up right here,

880
00:34:27,344 --> 00:34:29,724
