the back with him, Andy.

882
00:34:30,689 --> 00:34:32,103
I want, want a donut?

883
00:34:32,103 --> 00:34:33,758
Just kidding, a
 little cop humor.

884
00:34:35,034 --> 00:34:37,379
- What?
 - Oh, no, no, no.

885
00:34:40,310 --> 00:34:43,517
- [Crow] 7:15, Gannon and
 I headed back downtown.

886
00:34:45,000 --> 00:34:46,275
De bunco.

887
