 are you talkin' about,

895
00:35:02,655 --> 00:35:04,310
hit and run and manslaughter?

896
00:35:04,310 --> 00:35:06,206
- The accident you
 had in the park.

897
00:35:06,206 --> 00:35:07,034
Remember?

898
00:35:07,034 --> 00:35:08,034
- What accident?

899
00:35:08,034 --> 00:35:09,172
Where?

900
00:35:09,172 --> 00:35:11,172
- The car you sideswiped
on Canyon Road.

901
00:35:12,448 --> 00:35:14,241
A kid died in that wreck?

902
00:35:14,241 --> 00:35:16,068
- Sideswiped?

903
00:35:16,068 --> 00:35:17,000
What car?

904
00:35:17,000 --> 00:35:17,827
What are you talking about?

905
00:35:17,827 --> 00:35:19,310
- '49 For blue coupe.

906
00:35:20,275 --> 00:35:21,620
Kid's name was-

907
00:35:21,620 --> 00:35:22,655
- [Crow] James Dean?

908
00:35:22,655 --> 00:35:24,655
- Leonard DeMarco.

909
00:35:24,655 --> 00:35:27,724
- [Tom] Hey, I got a
 felt pen by that name.

910
00:35:27,724 --> 00:35:28,620
- [Crow] DeMarco?

911
00:35:28,620 --> 00:35:30,172
- Sonny?

912
00:35:30,172 --> 00:35:31,448
- [Joel] Dad!
 - Dead?

913
00:35:35,862 --> 00:35:37,965
- [Cop] Police examination
 having found your vehicle free

914
00:35:37,965 --> 00:35:40,482
