The judge read it to me, okay?

922
00:35:53,034 --> 00:35:54,275
- [Tom] Do I get the job or not?

923
00:35:54,275 --> 00:35:55,827
- Just wanted to make
 sure you understood.

924
00:35:55,827 --> 00:35:58,206
- [Radio] Cancel your prowler
 call, 12 and 15 have handled.

925
00:35:58,206 --> 00:36:00,206
- [Joel] So you enjoy Adam 12?

926
00:36:00,206 --> 00:36:01,413
- [Radio] 379 M.

927
00:36:03,655 --> 00:36:04,896
- Put a guy on probation,

928
00:36:04,896 --> 00:36:08,344
take away his driver's
 license, understood.

929
00:36:08,344 --> 00:36:10,655
- He could've made it a
lot worse on you, Phil.

930
00:36:10,655 --> 00:36:12,068
I'd say you were pretty lucky.

931
