956
00:36:56,793 --> 00:36:57,793
I've never been in an accident.

957
00:36:57,793 --> 00:36:58,965
I've never caused one.

958
00:36:58,965 --> 00:37:00,482
- Yeah, I know Phil.

959
00:37:00,482 --> 00:37:03,172
